graph LR
    subgraph "Cloud Framework (LangChain/AutoGPT)"
        U1[User] -->|Request| API[API Call]
        API -->|Network<br/>100-500ms| Cloud[Cloud Server]
        Cloud -->|Model Inference<br/>1-3s| OpenAI[OpenAI API]
        OpenAI -->|Response<br/>100-500ms| Cloud
        Cloud -->|Network<br/>100-500ms| U1
    end

    subgraph "Sparx (Edge Device)"
        U2[User] -->|Request<br/>0ms| Local[Local Processing]
